        "id": 13824
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-07T17:05:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Now that I think about it, I think it\u0027s a little confusing either way. But basically the use case in this CL is in a shader structure like this:\n\n```\nBlendShaderBlock(PriorOutputBlock(), DstColorBlock(), BlendModeBlenderBlock())\n```\n\nwhich I do think is a little clearer than:\n\n```\nBlendShaderBlock(PassthroughShaderBlock(), DstColorBlock(), BlendModeBlenderBlock())\n```\n\nHowever, that structure isn\u0027t super obvious from the way we have to actually set up these blocks, which looks more like:\n\n```\nBlendShaderBlock()\n\nPriorOutputBlock()       // src\nDstColorBlock()          // dst\nBlendModeBlenderBlock()  // blender\n\nendBlock()  // BlendShaderBlock()\n```\n\nAnd things get more confusing if we wanted to use prior stage output as the dst -- would a PriorOutputBlock/PassthroughShaderBlock use the src color block\u0027s output, or the output of whatever came before the BlendShaderBlock?? (The answer is: it uses whatever came before BlendShaderBlock, which is probably what we\u0027d always want, but not necessarily what I\u0027d expect from these examples.)\n\nAnyways, all that said, I do still think PriorOutputBlock is a little clearer than PassthroughShaderBlock.",
      "parentUuid": "5b8fe92d_dbde69ba",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 62,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 62,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "0e6c75d3f7bfddebfc18001c3407f3d3eb8ddb25",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
